 * Validate paginated/filtered retrieval of moderation logs as admin.
 *
 * This test validates that admin users can search moderation logs using all supported filters and that pagination and permission rules are enforced.
 *
 * Steps
 * 1. Create a base member (will serve as moderator/admin)
 * 2. Promote member to admin
 * 3. Create multiple moderation log entries with varied action_types and targets using the admin
 * 4. Retrieve logs using:
 *   a. Filter by moderator_id: should return only logs by that moderator
 *   b. Filter by action_type: only logs with that type
