 *    - Filter by issued_by_moderator_id and issued_by_admin_id: Results contain only matching issuer.
 *    - Filter by status (active, revoked, expired): Each returns only corresponding status.
 *    - Filter by time window (starts_at_from/to, ends_at_from/to): Results are date-restricted.
 *    - Pagination: Use small limit, verify division across pages and navigation (page > 1 returns correct subset, page out of range is empty).
 *    - Combination filters: e.g., issuer+status+date.
 *    - Edge filter: where no results (should get empty data array, correct pagination).
 * 4. Attempt to retrieve as unauthorized (simulate public): Should get 403 (TestValidator.error).
