 * 4. Delete the report as an 'authorized' actor (role handling not in API, assumed).
 * 5. Try deleting the same (now-deleted) report, expecting error.
 * 6. Try deleting a non-existent report, expecting error.
 * 7. (Role restriction and audit/review tests cannot be implemented—see notes.)
 *
 * Notes:
 * - Role-based authorization cannot be directly tested (auth/session flows missing from API).
 * - No endpoint to retrieve or verify deletion state/audit post-delete; assertions are based on API erroring as expected.
 * - If future endpoints allow role simulation, audit/log review, or ongoing review process, extend tests accordingly.
 */
export async function test_api_discussionboard_test_delete_comment_report_by_authorized_and_unauthorized_roles(
