 * This test exercises proper authorization, data flow, and audit compliance for moderator post deletion:
 * 1. Creates a regular member as the original post author (active status)
 * 2. Creates a separate member to be promoted to moderator
 * 3. Assigns the moderator role
 * 4. Creates a new thread (authored by the original member)
 * 5. The original author creates a post in the thread
 * 6. As the moderator, issues a soft-delete on the post (eraseById)
