 *  - A new topic tag is created and is active by default
 *  - The tag is then deleted (which performs a soft delete by setting it inactive, not hard-deletion)
 *  - The deletion returns a successful operation status
 *  - The tag no longer appears in lists of active topic tags
 *
 * The test covers requirements for tag visibility, moderation curation, and logical deletion practices required by compliance.
